# Git stewardship

**Canonical**: `docs/GIT_WORKFLOW.md` · Skills: `git-reference` (read) · `git-record` (write)

| Need | Do |
|------|----|
| Inspect state / decide checkpoint | `git-reference` |
| Commit · branch · tag · PR | `git-record` (respect `project-state.git_policy`) |
| New repo | `scripts/git-init.ps1|sh` via `maintain-bootstrap` |

Commit/push/merge = user-gated unless `git_policy.auto_commit: criterion`.  
**Never**: force-push main · amend pushed · `reset --hard` unasked · commit `.agents/memory/**` · `--no-verify`
